    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 37 Montrose Close is a spacious four-bedroom detached residence ideally positioned within this mature and well-established residential enclave. Offering generous proportions throughout, this fine home provides an excellent balance of living and bedroom accommodation, making it ideal for growing families. The well-proportioned interiors are filled with natural light and provide a practical layout with excellent potential for modernisation and personalisation, allowing the next owners to create a superb long-term family home.\n\nAccommodation\n\nThe ground floor comprises an entrance porch, playroom, living room, kitchen, and a dining room to the rear. These well-proportioned reception rooms provide excellent flexibility for family living and entertaining. Upstairs, the first-floor hosts four generously sized double bedrooms together with a family shower room, completing the accommodation.\n\nGardens\n\nTo the front, the property benefits from a cobblelock driveway, providing valuable off-street parking. The rear garden is private and well-proportioned, laid mainly in lawn with a patio area ideal for outdoor dining and relaxing. This space offers excellent potential for further landscaping and is perfectly suited for family use.\n\nLocation\n\nMontrose Close is a quiet, family-friendly cul-de-sac conveniently located in the heart of Artane, a mature and well-established residential suburb on Dublin's north side. The area offers a wide selection of schools, shops, parks and recreational amenities, along with excellent transport links providing easy access to the city centre, Dublin Airport, and the M1/M50 road networks. This is a highly convenient and sought-after residential location ideal for families.\n\nIf you would like a viewing, please email us or call the office on 01 8336555 to arrange an appointment. If you wish to place an offer, please visit www.sherryfitz.ie where you can register to make an offer on this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPlay Room - 2.19m x 4.87m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.56m x 4.65m\n\n\nDining Room - 3.23m x 4.14m\n\n\nKitchen - 3.71m x 3.05m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.65m x 3.47m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.35m x 3.38m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.35m x 4.03m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.87m x 3.19m\n\n\nShower Room - 1.65m x 3.17m\n\n\n"
